# ===== Secrets & credentials =====
# Broad on purpose: this project has a real history of credential exposure
# incidents during interactive development. Nothing matching these patterns
# should ever be committed, even temporarily.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*credentials*
*secrets*
*.pfx
kubeconfig
*.kubeconfig
azure-pipelines-secrets.yml

# ===== Infrastructure as Code state =====
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform/
.terraform.lock.hcl

# ===== Local dev artifacts =====
# Report Rendering's local output during development, before wiring to
# Azure Blob Storage — matches singleSlide_demo's own convention of never
# committing generated report artifacts.
*.pptx
*.pdf
local_output/

# ===== Docker =====
*.log

# ===== IDE =====
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# ===== OS =====
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
